1 CONC Downs, Oklahoma no longer exists.   It is now Cashion, Okla
1 CONC homa.  Sylvia was born in Oklahoma when it was still a terr
1 CONC itory.  Her father, William Hoyt, was born in Michigan. Hi
1 CONC s family left Michigan and moved to Wisconsin, Kansas and t
1 CONC hen settled in Oklahoma in 1890.  William Hoyt returned t
1 CONC o Michigan and married Frances Hathaway and they had a far
1 CONC m and a harness shop in Cashion, Oklahoma.  William develop
1 CONC ed pernicious anemia and gradually grew weaker.  They decid
1 CONC ed to return to Michigan to seek medical treatment for Will
1 CONC iam.  They moved back to Michigan in 1906.  Sylvia was rais
1 CONC ed in Porter Twp, Van Buren Co., MI, USA.
