1 CONC o work on the Erie Canal.  Many members of the Hand and Bra
1 CONC dley families worked on various canals.  It was very commo
1 CONC n for Irish people to do this.   It was also very common t
1 CONC o move back and forth between Canada and the United State
1 CONC s as the border was uninforced until 1907.
